# Git sniffs "binary" by looking for a NUL byte early in the file. A PDF's
# header is plain ASCII, so it gets misdetected as text and core.autocrlf
# rewrites its line endings on checkout, corrupting it. Mark them explicitly.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
